      "text": "<math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
